These may include:

ChangeNOW — cryptocurrency exchange services

ChangeNOW operates as an independent provider of exchange/swap services and may apply its own Terms of Service, Privacy Policy, AML/KYC procedures and restrictions.

ZetaWallet may also use blockchain providers, RPC nodes, infrastructure providers, hosting providers, security services, diagnostic services and other technical providers.

Such providers may process information in accordance with their own privacy policies and contractual terms.

